  "summary": "Software engineer with extensive experience building developer tools. I have a bias for action and take extreme ownership of tool quality and user experience.\n\nCurrently building developer tools and AI capabilities at Meta. \n\nI transitioned from aerospace and flight software to big tech, but am interested generally in solving problems and building things. \n\nI was a founding member of the avionics team for Larry Page’s electric flying car company (acquired by Boeing), which performed the first ever fully electric vertical takeoff and landing flight. \n\nIn my spare time, I have created open source projects with industry-wide impact and hundreds of millions of downloads. See https://github.com/cs01 for more details.",
