    "description": "Technical Lead for the Developer Tools pillar across Reality Labs: IDE, debugging, language services, and developer experience.\n\n- Presented Meta-wide AI coding courses (bootcampers, GenAcademy). White-glove onboarding for newly hired Engineering VPs.\n- Owner of the Reality Labs debugging experience and contributor to Meta-wide debugging tools and infra: agentic debugging integrations, company-wide symbol server, GSYM adoption, DWARF upgrades, LLDB Android platform rewrite (upstreamed to LLVM).\n- Designed transparent AOSP modifications to capture minidumps during crashes to enable better agentic debugging root cause analysis for production crashes at scale.\n- Built and improved LSP-compliant language servers for C++, Java, Kotlin, and C#. Fixed compilation database issues company-wide, reducing navigation disruptions for C++ developers.\n- Created a clang fork that catches null pointer dereferences at compile time; rolled out warnings at scale across the monorepo. (https://github.com/cs01/llvm-project)\n- Created the VS Code Reality Labs extension used by thousands of developers monthly. Drove CodeLens, language server, debugger integrations, and more.",
